{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HvBVVa9crdvHv4576L41x6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-16-0200-batch-fold-ple-descriptor-array\n2\t\n3\tThe logup_zerocheck `fold_ple_evals` function (mod.rs:1478-1594), called within the Round 0 span, launches one `fold_ple_from_evals_kernel` per matrix per trace in a sequential loop. At APC 300 this creates ~800 individual kernel launches (nsight: 797 instances of `fold_ple_from_evals_kernel<false>`, 9.5ms total, avg 12μs). Each launch serializes on the GPU stream, preventing concurrent SM utilization across traces. Replacing the per-trace loop with a single batched descriptor-array kernel launch enables concurrent processing across all trace matrices, converting serial kernel time into parallel execution while eliminating ~795 kernel launch overhead cycles.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"80cd739d-0408-463a-95a7-972cb66aaf37","uuid":"25048655-a269-4f2a-92f8-faab18f59c33","timestamp":"2026-04-16T03:15:04.520Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-16-0200-batch-fold-ple-descriptor-array\n\nThe logup_zerocheck `fold_ple_evals` function (mod.rs:1478-1594), called within the Round 0 span, launches one `fold_ple_from_evals_kernel` per matrix per trace in a sequential loop. At APC 300 this creates ~800 individual kernel launches (nsight: 797 instances of `fold_ple_from_evals_kernel<false>`, 9.5ms total, avg 12μs). Each launch serializes on the GPU stream, preventing concurrent SM utilization across traces. Replacing the per-trace loop with a single batched descriptor-array kernel launch enables concurrent processing across all trace matrices, converting serial kernel time into parallel execution while eliminating ~795 kernel launch overhead cycles.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
