{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LeKTLAe4tdZoW5QQbkcntp","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 4863c316d859d7d31f89e82d978afcea44f90849\nAuthor: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>\nDate:   Wed Apr 15 09:56:13 2026 +0200\n\n    Increase default VPMM page size to 16 MiB (8x granularity)\n    \n    Reduces cuMemCreate driver call overhead for large GPU memory\n    allocations. Each cuMemCreate has ~0.4ms overhead; with 2 MiB pages\n    a 256 MiB allocation requires 128 calls (~51ms), with 16 MiB pages\n    it requires only 16 calls (~6ms).\n    \n    Allocations smaller than 16 MiB now use cudaMallocAsync instead of\n    VPMM, eliminating page tracking and defragmentation overhead for\n    medium-sized buffers.\n    \n    The VPMM_PAGE_SIZE environment variable can still override this default.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\ndiff --git a/crates/cuda-common/src/memory_manager/vm_pool.rs b/crates/cuda-common/src/memory_manager/vm_pool.rs\nindex 426191fb..5207d7cd 100644\n--- a/crates/cuda-common/src/memory_manager/vm_pool.rs\n+++ b/crates/cuda-common/src/memory_manager/vm_pool.rs\n@@ -166,7 +166,15 @@ impl VirtualMemoryPool {\n                             );\n                             size\n                         }\n-                        None => granularity,\n+                        None => {\n+                            // Use 8x the minimum granularity (typically 16 MiB) to reduce\n+                            // the number of cuMemCreate calls for large allocations.\n+                            // Each cuMemCreate has ~0.4ms driver overhead; with 2 MiB pages\n+                            // a 256 MiB allocation requires 128 calls (~51ms). With 16 MiB\n+                            // pages it requires only 16 calls (~6ms).\n+                            // Allocations smaller than the page size use cudaMallocAsync.\n+                            8 * granularity\n+                        }\n                     };\n \n                     // Validate va_size","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VsFWvH1ZUbtcR8rKDCrN4x","session_id":"80cd739d-0408-463a-95a7-972cb66aaf37","uuid":"b8890003-4e8f-4577-a1f9-5d0caf658f5f","timestamp":"2026-04-16T03:20:44.713Z"}
