 - Replace f_coeffs and w_moments with folded versions\n\n       c) RS ENCODING & MERKLE (lines 272-354)\n          - Allocate g_coeffs (f_height * D_EF elements)\n          - Call split_ext_to_base_col_major_matrix()\n          \n          If not last round:\n            - Allocate g_rs (D_EF * codeword_height elements)\n            - Call batch_expand_pad() to expand to RS domain\n            - Call batch_ntt() for FFT\n            - Create MerkleTreeGpu with hash\n            - Evaluate polynomial at z_0 point\n          \n          If last round:\n            - Transfer g_coeffs to host\n            - Construct final polynomial\n\n       d) MERKLE QUERIES (lines 356-464)\n          - If whir_round == 0:\n            - batch_query_merkle_proofs() on initial backing matrices\n            - batch_open_rows() from stacked traces\n          - Else:\n            - batch_query_merkle_proofs() on g_tree\n            - batch_open_rows() from g_tree backing matrix\n\n       e) MOMENT UPDATES (lines 468-511)\n          If not last round:\n            - Compute z0_pows2 and z_pows2 (powers for query accumulation)\n            - Allocate d_z0_pows2 and d_z_pows2\n            - Call w_moments_accumulate()\n\nEOF\ncat /tmp/whir_analysis.txt\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":935,"cache_read_input_tokens":58575,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":935,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VsFWvH1ZUbtcR8rKDCrN4x","session_id":"80cd739d-0408-463a-95a7-972cb66aaf37","uuid":"000f7976-b79e-4059-bcd0-86da5c1b8bf0"}
