duction.rs` | 114-200+ |\n| **Merkle hash scheme dispatch** | `crates/cuda-backend/src/hash_scheme.rs` | 30-242 |\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nThe Trace Commit implementation:\n1. **Stacks** all input traces by height into a single matrix\n2. **RS encodes** the stacked matrix at rate `2^{-log_blowup}`\n3. **Compresses rows** with Poseidon2 hashing (once per stacked matrix)\n4. **Builds Merkle tree** by iteratively compressing adjacent digest pairs\n5. **Returns the root** digest to the transcript\n\nThe constraint evaluation (Round 0) reads from **original traces**, not the Merkle tree, enabling **partial parallelization** of row hashing with constraint evaluation on different CUDA streams."}],"totalDurationMs":88752,"totalTokens":75890,"totalToolUseCount":28,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":269,"cache_read_input_tokens":71413,"output_tokens":4208,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":269},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":4208,"cache_read_input_tokens":71413,"cache_creation_input_tokens":269,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":269,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":17,"searchCount":9,"bashCount":2,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
