ry_limit_bytes` parameter\n  - Memory-aware batching in `evaluate_logup_batched()` and `evaluate_zerocheck_batched()`\n\n### 9. **Complete Per-Round Kernel Launch Sequence**\n\n**For each MLE round (1 to n_max):**\n\n1. **Interpolation:** `batched_interpolate_columns_matrix_gpu()` (Case B traces only)\n2. **Zerocheck evaluation:**\n   - `ZerocheckMonomialBatch::evaluate()` (low num_y, always monomial)\n   - `zerocheck_batch_eval_mle()` via DAG (high num_y, high monomial-to-rules)\n   - `ZerocheckMonomialParYBatch::evaluate()` (high num_y, high monomial-to-rules)\n3. **Logup evaluation:**\n   - `LogupMonomialBatch::evaluate()` (num_y ≤ threshold)\n   - `logup_batch_eval_mle()` via `LogupMleBatchBuilder` (num_y > threshold)\n4. **Fold matrices:** `batch_fold_mle()` (only for foldable traces with height > 1)\n5. **Fold selectors:** `batch_fold_mle()` (only for foldable selectors with height > 1)\n\n**D2H Synchronization:** Implicit in each `to_host()` call on evaluation outputs\n\n---\n\n## Summary Table\n\n| Component | File | Location | Per-Trace or Per-Round |\n|-----------|------|----------|------------------------|\n| `compute_logup_combinations()` | `batch_mle_monomial.rs` | 509-580 | **Per-Trace (once)** |\n| `sumcheck_polys_batch_eval()` | `mod.rs` | 1602-2008 | **Per-Round** |\n| `batched_interpolate_columns_matrix_gpu()` | Kernel | - | **Per-Round** |\n| `logup_batch_eval_mle()` | Kernel | - | **Per-Round** |\n| `zerocheck_batch_eval_mle()` | Kernel | - | **Per-Round** |\n| `batch_fold_mle()` | Kernel | - | **Per-Round** |\n| `fold_mle_evals()` | `mod.rs` | 2086-2238 | **Per-Round** |\n| `monomial_num_y_threshold` | `gpu_backend.rs` | 108 | Applied per-round in partitioning |\n| Ping-pong buffers | `mod.rs` | 622-647, 805-808 | **Allocated once, reused all rounds** |"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"80cd739d-0408-463a-95a7-972cb66aaf37","uuid":"e4e47d01-625d-45de-bbb4-11b1ba4024ab","timestamp":"2026-04-16T03:43:09.087Z","tool_use_result":{"status