{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WeMX8yU5FeYeRzrEFA237y","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (21.9KB). Full output saved to: /home/georg/.claude/projects/-home-georg-stark-backend/80cd739d-0408-463a-95a7-972cb66aaf37/tool-results/toolu_01WeMX8yU5FeYeRzrEFA237y.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0600-tune-vpmm-page-size-for-whir/plan.md:23:### Impact on WHIR (`crates/cuda-backend/src/whir.rs:100-175`)\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0600-tune-vpmm-page-size-for-whir/plan.md:31:- **2 MiB pages (baseline)**: STARK excl trace APC 300 = 2455ms, WHIR = 100ms\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0600-tune-vpmm-page-size-for-whir/plan.md:32:- **16 MiB pages (current)**: STARK excl trace APC 300 = 1110ms (-1345ms), WHIR = 128ms (+28ms)\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0600-tune-vpmm-page-size-for-whir/plan.md:43:# Test 1: Baseline page size (2 MiB) — should recover WHIR to ~100ms\nautoopt-results/2026-04-16-0030-hoist-mle-trace-ctx-construction/report.md:38:| WHIR | 100ms | 192ms | 126ms avg | +26ms, 1.26x higher | -66ms (noise) |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1500-batch-stacking-scatter-kernel/report.md:44:| WHIR | 100ms | 100ms | 101ms | +1ms | +1ms |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-15-2230-prealloc-whir-fold-buffers/report.md:5:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-15-2230-prealloc-whir-fold-buffers/report.md:24:| **WHIR APC 300** | 100ms | 130ms | 126ms | +26ms, 1.26x higher | -4ms, 1.03x lower |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-15-2230-prealloc-whir-fold-buffers/report.md:26:| **WHIR APC 100** | 138ms | 154ms | 156ms | +18ms, 1.13x higher | +2ms (noise) |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-15-2230-prealloc-whir-fold-buffers/report.md:45:- The WHIR phase has regressed 26ms from baseline (100ms → 126ms) across previous optimizations. This regression is likely due to accumulated VPMM pool state changes from other optimizations (similar to patterns seen in `cache-codeword-buffer-across-segments` and `multistream-stacked-reduction-round0`), not allocation overhead within WHIR itself.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-15-2230-prealloc-whir-fold-buffers/plan.md:7:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/2026-04-15-2230-prealloc-whir-fold-buffers/plan.md:33:- WHIR round 0, inner round 0: output_height = 2^23, size = 128 MiB → VPMM (8 pages)\n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J17JjUQ3eVEaLrWxZRQ1KK","session_id":"80cd739d-0408-463a-95a7-972cb66aaf37","uuid":"0105c6a9-3de1-46b0-9297-5c4359f4b37f","timestamp":"2026-04-16T04:36:08.520Z"}
